@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Application health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Diagnostic dependency status
# This probes currently configured MySQL and Redis clients. It does not enable persistence or cache.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/system/status

### Swagger UI (open this URL in a browser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui.html

### Trusted literature search: live external result varies by provider availability
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/literature/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "近五年遥感变化检测研究",
  "fromYear": 2021,
  "toYear": 2026,
  "limit": 5
}

### Day 5 trusted RAG answer (disabled by default; reads active index only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/research/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "状态空间模型如何用于遥感影像变化检测？",
  "topK": 5,
  "fromYear": 2021,
  "toYear": 2026,
  "paperIds": []
}

### Valid contract boundary: minimum allowed result limit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/literature/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "remote sensing change detection",
  "fromYear": 2021,
  "toYear": 2026,
  "limit": 1
}

### Optional chat endpoint: requires LLM_ENABLED=true
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "什么是 RAG？"
}
